&lt;li&gt;Various UI and style improvements: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8537&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8537/hovercard&quot;&gt;#8537&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8538&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8538/hovercard&quot;&gt;#8538&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br&gt;
