&lt;li&gt;Fix HTTPS headers given to SimplePie, e.g. for some HTTP/2 cases &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8742&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8742/hovercard&quot;&gt;#8742&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
